  "why": {
    "tokens": [
      {
        "t": "text",
        "v": "A planning run throws away its planned orders and makes them again, so a small change can move orders you were about to act on. The time fence is a date, and before it LN keeps the planned orders it already has. Two boxes decide whether the fence counts, one on the item and one on the run. It holds only when the item's box is selected and the run's is cleared."
      }
    ],
